    { version="0.94.9", date="2026-09-26", items={
      { zh="修复插件账号串绑定：网页默认复制独立的 /giaccount 命令，不再依赖可能被整合包覆盖的 /gi 总入口；旧 /gi account 命令继续兼容。", en="Fixes addon account-key binding. The site now copies the dedicated /giaccount command instead of relying on the /gi dispatcher, which can be overridden by addon suites; /gi account remains supported.", tw="修正插件帳號串綁定：網頁預設複製獨立的 /giaccount 指令，不再依賴可能被整合包覆蓋的 /gi 總入口；舊 /gi account 指令仍可使用。", kind="fixed" },
